OL,3,GNEWSASon sentenced over delay in
OL,4,Ahelping mother who died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was the sole carer for his
OL,7,Felderly mother has been sentenced after
OL,8,Fadmitting he failed to request
OL,9,Fpotentially life-saving treatment for
OL,10,Fher soon enough.
OL,12,FParamedics were called to Avril Upton's
OL,13,Fhome in Main Street, Ticknall,
OL,14,FDerbyshire, on 22 April 2021 to reports
OL,15,Fshe was seriously unwell. They found
OL,16,Fher living in squalid conditions,
OL,17,Fsitting in an armchair "soaked with
OL,18,Furine and heavily soiled with faeces".
OL,20,FThe 84-year-old was transferred to
OL,21,Fhospital and died the same day.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
